 that it could replace our own service. It was a simple replacement - a real success story for us.",quote_two:"We realised the safer option would be to let someone else handle external screenshots for us. I tested a couple of products. The thing it boiled down to was emojis. We believe in emojis being an integral part of modern communication, so having proper support for emojis was a necessity, not a luxury.",title:"Head of Engineering",url:"https://whimsical.com/"},{avatar:{src:__turbopack_context__.i(988705).default,width:272,height:272,blurWidth:8,blurHeight:8,blurDataURL:"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},company:"ReviewTycoon",description:"Over 500 review sites with more than 160,000 reviews are powered by ReviewTycoon.",language:"PHP",lead_quote:"I love the support that Urlbox provides. Normally when I have a new feature request like WebP images or blocking cookie pop-ups, I email support and get a response saying it's already possible - within minutes.",location:"Oegstgeest, the Netherlands",logo:__TURBOPACK__default__export__15,name:"Rutger Tolenaar",page:"/customers/reviewtycoon",quote_one:"I used to have to visit every website, take a screenshot with a keyboard shortcut then upload manually via FTP. Urlbox makes it so much easier, everything is automatic and I don't have to ask my customers to install browser plugins.",quote_three:"I love the support that Urlbox provides. Normally when I have a new feature request like WebP images or blocking cookie pop-ups, I email support and get a response saying it's already possible - within minutes.",quote_two:"Our mission is to make our website as easy as possible for all our customers. It's way more difficult to use other services - it can take 5 minutes to add a review! Thanks to Urlbox it takes like 10 seconds.",title:"Founder",url:"https://www.reviewtycoon.com/"},{avatar:__TURBOPACK__default__export__14,company:"Swiped.co",description:"Marketers, copywriters & savvy business minds get inspiration for their next big promotion from Swiped.co.",language:"PHP",lead_quote:"It's so evident that Urlbox really cares and pays attention. It's rare that I need customer support but, when I do, I know one of the team will get right back to me.",location:"New Jersey, United States",logo:{src:__turbopack_context__.i(857419).default,width:178,height:48,blurWidth:8,blurHeight:2,blurDataURL:"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAgAAAACCAYAAABllJ3tAAAATUlEQVR42gFCAL3/AGxzl1l6hLJqgoy6an+HtG2DirhvbXaeWn2Esml1e6hmAHN9pl58hrZqf4WwZ3+FsGiAibZpbnehWXF2n1tscJhXOxwgbHSgHzwAAAAASUVORK5CYII="},name:"Mike Schauer",page:"/customers/swiped",quote_one:"I was using browser extensions to capture screenshots of websites. I analysed and organised hundreds of examples of copywriting and marketing promotions - manually processing and uploading each screenshot. Urlbox allowed me to streamline this with a Wordpress integration.",quote_three:"It's so evident that Urlbox really cares and pays attention. It's rare that I need customer support but, when I do, I know one of the team will get right back to me.",quote_two:"There are so many screenshot services out there. They're fine if you're just doing thumbnails, you don't really care about quality or configuration options. It didn't take me long to find holes and hit the limitations of every one I tried. Urlbox has every feature I've ever needed to take great screenshots every time.",title:"Founder",url:"https://swiped.co/"},{avatar:__TURBOPACK__default__export__13,company:"Flux",description:"Build hardware more efficiently with real-time collaboration, an easy to use simulator, and forkable community content.",language:"JavaScript",lead_quote:"It would have been so cumbersome to implement a service of our own to take screenshots. Urlbox's API is so straightforward, and the live preview is cool. I can play around with the parameters and see it do what I need it to do.",location:"California, United States",logo_svg:function SvgFlux(props){return __TURBOPACK__imported__module__191788__.createElement("svg",_extends6({width:138,height:40,viewBox:"0 0 138 40",fill:"none",xmlns:"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"},props),_path3||(_path3=__TURBOPACK__imported__module__191788__.createElement("path",{d:"M41.3372 1.42482V38.4226H36.5934V1.42482H41.3372ZM42.7631 0H35.1674V39.8474H42.7631V0Z",fill:"#a5b4fc"})),_path21||(_path21=__TURBOPACK__imported__module__191788__.createElement("path",{d:"M104.625 12.4197L96.478 24.2219L95.9171 25.0341L96.4827 25.8462L105.262 38.4226H100.262L94.1108 29.3133L92.932 27.5703L91.7484 29.3085L85.5406 38.4226H80.5782L89.2624 25.8415L89.8186 25.0341L89.2624 24.2267L81.1628 12.4149H86.1871L91.7437 20.6884L92.932 22.4599L94.1156 20.6836L99.6104 12.4197H104.625ZM107.339 10.9949H98.8499L92.932 19.8952L86.9523 10.9949H78.4629L88.0884 25.0341L77.864 39.8522H86.2964L92.932 30.1159L99.5106 39.8522H108L97.6568 25.0341L107.339 10.9949Z",fill:"#a5b4fc"})),_path31||(_path31=__TURBOPACK__imported__module__191788__.createElement("path",{d:"M30.3118 7.29032V0H2.09146V8.19745V9.69351L3.5935 11.1943L0 14.7801L3.58875 18.3659L0 21.9564L3.58875 25.5422L0 29.1328L2.09146 31.2225V32.3671V39.8474H10.5809V23.2388H29.8936V15.9532H10.5809V7.29032H30.3118ZM10.5809 17.378H28.4676V21.8187H10.5809H9.15487V23.2435V38.4226H3.51745V32.3671V30.6288L2.0154 29.128L5.60415 25.5422L2.0154 21.9564L5.60415 18.3707L2.0154 14.7849L5.60415 11.1991L3.51269 9.10934V8.2022V1.42482H28.8811V5.8655H10.5809H9.15487V7.29032V15.9532V17.378H10.5809V17.378Z",fill:"#a5b4fc"})),_path4||(_path4=__TURBOPACK__imported__module__191788__.createElement("path",{d:"M73.5906 12.3376V25.5996C73.5906 34.4021 69.7404 38.5035 61.4744 38.5035C53.2084 38.5035 49.3582 34.4021 49.3582 25.5996V12.3376H54.102V25.5996C54.102 33.7186 58.7222 34.9322 61.4792 34.9322C64.2361 34.9322 68.8563 33.7186 68.8563 25.5996V12.3376H73.5906ZM75.0166 10.9426H67.4208V25.5996C67.4208 29.8776 66.0186 33.5372 61.4697 33.5372C56.9255 33.5372 55.5185 29.8776 55.5185 25.5996V10.9426H47.9227V25.5996C47.9227 35.1322 52.3148 39.8985 61.4649 39.8985C70.615 39.8985 75.0071 35.1322 75.0071 25.5996V10.9426H75.0166Z",fill:"#a5b4fc"})))},name:"Matthias Wagner",page:"/customers/flux",quote_one:"We wanted to have something visual when people share their projects on Facebook, Twitter, Slack and so on. We wanted them to have a nice screenshot of their actual circuit on social media. I setup Urlbox and I've not had to touch it in many many months.",quote_three:"We use React and Three.js, for the screenshot we only cared about a WebGL render into a specific canvas element. Urlbox's configuration options allowed us to use a custom selector, wait for it to load, control caching and set the user agent so we could easily filter requests out of analytics. All that with purely frontend code. And it's fast!",quote_two:"It would have been so cumbersome to implement a service of our own to take screenshots. Urlbox's API is so straightforward, and the live preview is cool. I can play around with the parameters and see it do what I need it to do.",title:"CEO",url:"https://www.flux.ai/"}];__turbopack_context__.s(["default",0,props=>(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsx)("section",{className:"bg-indigo-800 sm:m-4 m-1 mt-4 rounded-xl",children:Customers.filter(obj=>obj.company===props.company).map((c,idx)=>(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsx)("div",{className:"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8",children:(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsxs)("div",{className:"py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 flex flex-col md:py-16 ",children:[(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsxs)("div",{className:"shrink-0 mx-auto",children:[c.logo&&(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsx)(__TURBOPACK__imported__module__126019__.default,{className:"h-8 sm:h-12",src:c.logo,alt:c.company,style:{maxWidth:"100%",height:"auto"}}),c.logo_svg&&(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsx)(c.logo_svg,{className:"h-8 sm:h-12",alt:c.company})]}),(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsxs)("blockq